<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Review the draft privacy information for Shane Perez’s personal professional website." noindex={true}><PageHero eyebrow="Legal Review Draft" title="Privacy Policy" description="This document is a structured operational draft and requires Shane’s, compliance’s, and qualified legal counsel’s review before publication." breadcrumbs={[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'Privacy Policy'}]}/><section class="section"><div class="container prose"><DisclosureNotice type="warning" title="Not legal advice"><p>[APPROVED PRIVACY POLICY AND DATA-PROTECTION CONTACT REQUIRED BEFORE LAUNCH]</p></DisclosureNotice><h2>1. Website scope</h2><p>This personal professional website presents Shane Perez’s leadership story, career opportunities, educational content, and inquiry pathways. It is not the official corporate website of Manulife Philippines.</p><h2>2. Information that may be collected</h2><p>Depending on the form used, the website may collect contact information, professional background, application information, résumé files, consultation preferences, messages, consent records, security data, and consented analytics information.</p><h2>3. Purposes</h2><p>Information may be used to review recruitment applications, respond to consultation or contact requests, protect the website, maintain consent choices, and measure approved website performance.</p><h2>4. Résumés and recruitment records</h2><p>Résumé files must be stored privately. Authorized recipients receive a time-limited protected link. The final policy must define retention, deletion, access, correction, and lawful-processing procedures.</p><h2>5. Recipients and service providers</h2><p>[IDENTIFY AUTHORIZED RECIPIENTS, HOSTING, EMAIL, SECURITY, STORAGE, AND ANALYTICS PROVIDERS AFTER FINAL CONFIGURATION]</p><h2>6. Cookies and analytics</h2><p>Non-essential analytics and marketing tools remain off until the visitor provides the required consent. See the <a href="/cookie-notice/">Cookie Notice</a>.</p><h2>7. Retention and security</h2><p>[APPROVED RETENTION SCHEDULE, SECURITY CONTROLS, AND INCIDENT PROCESS REQUIRED]</p><h2>8. Rights and contact</h2><p>[DATA-PROTECTION CONTACT, APPLICABLE RIGHTS, COMPLAINT PROCESS, AND RESPONSE PROCEDURE REQUIRED]</p><h2>9. Effective date and changes</h2><p>[EFFECTIVE DATE AND VERSION REQUIRED]</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
